WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.958
Forms in inboxes. Approvals in limbo.

00:00:04.227 --> 00:00:05.996
Records... somewhere.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:11.512
Meet Approovia Workspace Manager. Every form, workflow and

00:00:11.588 --> 00:00:14.050
approval, in one workspace.

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:18.781
Build the form. Upload a paper one, and the AI agent turns it

00:00:18.858 --> 00:00:20.550
into a digital form.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.162
Map every approval on a visual canvas.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.354
Your rules, your approvers.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:32.765
Then it runs itself, moving each request from desk to desk.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.800
And with forms and workflows, you also get memos, signatures,

00:00:38.877 --> 00:00:41.877
documents and filing, and RAG search.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:46.019
Each decision becomes a signed memo, so you always know who

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.481
approved what.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:52.585
Your signature is drawn once, verified with a one-time code, and

00:00:52.662 --> 00:00:54.662
ready wherever you sign.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:59.146
Documents and Filing keeps every file organised, with permissions

00:00:59.223 --> 00:01:00.915
on who can see what.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:06.385
And with RAG search, every form, memo and file is indexed, so you

00:01:06.423 --> 00:01:10.192
can simply ask, and get the answer, with its source.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:15.008
Case Files bring it all together: the forms, documents and memos

00:01:15.085 --> 00:01:18.085
behind every case, in one view.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:25.208
Approovia Workspace Manager. Digital transformation, simplified.

00:01:25.246 --> 00:01:28.073
Visit Approovia dot com.
